OLIVE OIL  ke liye 1,568 pcs\n• PM0000873 TIKKI BARCODE CSD 1 LTR POMACE — JIVO POMACE OLIVE OIL 1 LTR  ke liye 304 pcs\nOrder kar do please, 6 din ka lead hai.","tag":"packaging-zero","assumed":false},{"day":"2026-08-29","dir":"in","text":"Kar diya — TIKKI BARCODE CSD 1 LTR  6 din mein.","tag":"packaging-zero","assumed":true}],"count":10},{"name":"Gurvinderjeet Singh","whatsapp":"+919319379079","display":"+91 93193 79079","title":"Owns monthly planning (inferred)","messages":[{"day":"2026-08-06","dir":"out","text":"Veerji, ek decision. Packaging baar baar zero ho raha hai — labels aur caps ke liye har hafte line rukti hai. Do raste: (1) har item ka 15 din ka buffer rakhein, ya (2) Kulbir veerji ko hafte ka forecast bhejein taaki woh pehle order kar sakein. Kya karein?","tag":"decision","assumed":false},{"day":"2026-08-06","dir":"in","text":"Forecast bhejo. Buffer mein paisa fasta hai.","tag":"decision","assumed":true},{"day":"2026-08-08","dir":"out","text":"Veerji, week 1: 587,651 L bana, ₹10.1 Cr. Lines 72% pe, godown 100%. Storage ab problem nahi hai — material aur line hours hi limit hain.","tag":"weekly","assumed":false},{"day":"2026-08-15","dir":"out","text":"Veerji, week 2: 826,073 L bana, ₹14.3 Cr. Lines 51% pe, godown 100%. Storage ab problem nahi hai — material aur line hours hi limit hain.","tag":"weekly","assumed":false},{"day":"2026-08-22","dir":"out","text":"Veerji, week 3: 1,312,664 L bana, ₹24.9 Cr. Lines 55% pe, godown 74%. Storage ab problem nahi hai — material aur line hours hi limit hain.","tag":"weekly","assumed":false},{"day":"2026-08-29","dir":"out","text":"Veerji, week 4: 2,017,730 L bana, ₹38.9 Cr. Lines 64% pe, godown 90%. Storage ab problem nahi hai — material aur line hours hi limit hain.","tag":"weekly","assumed":false}],"count":5},{"name":"Ravinder Singh","whatsapp":"+918278800571","display":"+91 82788 00571","title":"PM Purchase incharge","messages":[{"day":"2026-08-03","dir":"out","text":"Shunty veerji, oil short:\n• CANOLA COLD PRESS LOOSE OIL OLD — REFINED OIL 5 LTR\n• CANOLA COLD PRESS LOOSE OIL OLD — REFINED OIL 1000 MLS\n• CANOLA COLD PRESS LOOSE OIL OLD — REFINED OIL 5 LTR\nOrder nikal diya hai, 11 din. Koi jaldi source ho toh batao.","tag":"oil-short","assumed":false},{"day":"2026-08-03","dir":"in","text":"Arora se dekh leta hoon.","tag":"oil-short","assumed":true},{"day":"2026-08-10","dir":"out","text":"Shunty veerji, oil short:\n• LOOSE REFINED OLIVE OIL — EXTRA VIRGIN OLIVE 500 MLS\n• LOOSE REFINED OLIVE OIL — SANO POMACE OLIVE 1 LTR 16\n• LOOSE REFINED OLIVE OIL — EXTRA LIGHT OLIVE 1 LTR 16\nOrder nikal diya hai, 11 din. Koi jaldi source ho toh batao.","tag":"oil-short","assumed":false},{"day":"2026-08-10","dir":"in","text":"Arora se dekh leta hoon.","tag":"oil-short","assumed":true},{"day":"2026-08-11","dir":"out","text":"LOOSE REFINED OLIVE OIL zero pe tha — 96,344 ka order nikal diya, 22 Aug tak aa jayega (11 din). Tab tak doosra SKU line pe chala rahe hain.","tag":"ordered","assumed":false},{"day":"2026-08-11","dir":"in","text":"Theek hai, confirm kar deta hoon.","tag":"ordered","assumed":true}],"count":3},{"name":"Gurpreet Singh (Gopi)","whatsapp":"+917982571810","display":"+91 79825 71810","title":"Oil tracker","messages":[{"day":"2026-08-01","dir":"out","text":"Gopi bhai, godown 112% pe hai — jo bill kat gaye hain unki gaadi aaj hi lagwao, warna production rokna padega.","tag":"storage","assumed":false},{"day":"2026-08-01","dir":"in","text":"Haan, gaadi laga di hain.","tag":"storage","assumed":true}],"count":1},{"name":"Preshit Singh","whatsapp":"+918178047679","display":"+91 81780 47679","title":"Monthly planning and billing head","messages":[{"day":"2026-08-07","dir":"out","text":"Preshit bhai, veerji ne bola weekly packaging forecast bhejna hai. Main har Monday nikal doonga — agle 15 din mein kya chahiye, kis SKU ke liye. Aap Kulbir veerji ke saath review kar lena.","tag":"decision","assumed":false},{"day":"2026-08-07","dir":"in","text":"Haan bhej do, main dekh loonga.","tag":"decision","assumed":true}],"count":1}]}]}],"$L6"]}],["$L7"],"$L8"]}],"isPartial":"$@9","staleTime":"$a","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$Lb","isPartial":"$@c","staleTime":"$a","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$Ld","isPartial":"$@e","staleTime":"$a","varyParams":"$f"},{"rsc":"$L10","isPartial":"$@11","staleTime":"$a","varyParams":null}],"isUpgradeableISRFallback":false,"a":"$@12","rootVaryParams":null,"needsRuntimeRequest":"$@13"}
